Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Create New User Account
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Configuration|
	And Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowResourceValue|User|
	And User logout PG
	And WorkflowAsset create New User Account
		|userEmailAddress|user@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
		|workflow|true|
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User search CP
		|searchTerm|usersn|
	And User view No Users Found CP
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|userfn userln|
		|workflowAssetType|User|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|userfn userln|
		|workflowAssetType|User|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|user@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	Then User logout And Login PG
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|user@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
